// Des: SSRF guard: block private hosts, loop-proof redirects
// Flo: strip brackets > block bad names > literal ip check > odd numeric forms refused > resolve name > every address must be public
// I/O: host text + io (fetcher) > ok or error.BlockedHost; redirect urls > ok or error.RedirectLoop
